    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0445" n="187" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg187"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/713</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">
                        Knauth, Nachod and Kuhne to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 11, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>May we safely ship cotton linters as non-contraband goods same as cotton to
                    Bremen?</p>
                <closer>
                    
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knauth, Nachod and Kuhne</hi>
                    
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
